---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<Base title="VoltUI deployment" titleEn="VoltUI deployment" titleZh="VoltUI 部署" description="Prepare and distribute the VoltUI Electron shell with the official DeepSeek Harness runtime.">
  <SiteHeader active="enterprise" />
  <main class="wrap"><section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">DEPLOYMENT / 部署</div><h1>Prepare the runtime contract once, then distribute the reviewed package.</h1><p>VoltUI is a desktop shell, not a second agent engine. Administrators pin Node 26, the exact official DSH package, the profile patch and the model endpoint policy.</p></section><section class="home-section"><div class="value-grid"><article><span class="value-no">01</span><h3>Prepare</h3><p>Mirror the installer and lockfile, review <code>profiles/anyong.yml</code>, and inject credentials through deployment environment or DSH settings.</p></article><article><span class="value-no">02</span><h3>Verify</h3><p>Run DSH integration, Electron boundary, migration boundary, site build and package checks on the exact commit.</p></article><article><span class="value-no">03</span><h3>Distribute</h3><p>Publish the Windows x64 unsigned-review artifact only after hashes and signature state are recorded. Production signing remains a separate approval boundary.</p></article></div></section><section class="network-section"><div class="network-grid"><div class="section-copy"><div class="eyebrow">TOPOLOGY / 拓扑</div><h2>Loopback shell, local workspace, explicit provider.</h2><p>Electron starts the official DSH web profile on <code>127.0.0.1</code> with an ephemeral port. The browser window only accepts that origin; the DSH process owns the agent surface.</p></div><div class="network-map"><div class="network-zone prep"><span class="zone-label">Preparation zone / 准备区</span><div><strong>Installer + lockfile</strong><small>reviewed commit · Node 26</small></div><div><strong>Profile patch</strong><small>Anyong/VoltUI identity and model defaults</small></div></div><div class="network-gate"><span>controlled launch</span></div><div class="network-zone runtime"><span class="zone-label">Runtime zone / 运行区</span><div><strong>Electron window</strong><small>isolated local shell</small></div><div class="emphasis"><strong>Official DSH</strong><small>sessions · tools · credentials</small></div></div></div></div></section><section class="boundary-section"><div class="boundary-grid"><article class="boundary yes"><h3>Verification gates</h3><ul><li>Node 26.7.0 / pnpm 11.23.0</li><li>Exact DSH version and frozen lockfile</li><li>Electron runtime boundary and package path</li><li>Unsigned Windows x64 artifact identity</li></ul></article><article class="boundary no"><h3>Not included</h3><ul><li>Automatic production signing or notarization</li><li>Cloud control plane or centralized audit console</li><li>Legacy runtime compatibility line</li></ul></article></div></section></main><SiteFooter />
</Base>
